WEBVTT

00:03:56.983 --> 00:04:01.487
All of this in an effort to bring back
ownership of their heritage

00:04:01.529 --> 00:04:04.657
and make them stewards of their own land

00:04:04.657 --> 00:04:06.867
and also of their own future.

00:04:08.077 --> 00:04:09.704
But see, through the years,

00:04:09.704 --> 00:04:12.957
that trust that I've mentioned
before, grew stronger.

00:04:12.999 --> 00:04:17.378
So now they scold me, they teach,
they feed, they protect me,

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:20.006
they tell me secrets of their traditions.

00:04:20.047 --> 00:04:23.009
Children tease me and call me names,

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:26.721
but I will never be one of them.

00:04:27.054 --> 00:04:31.142
And thus they will never
fully, truly trust me.